  "<g1>We estimate ANA Captains at about <x2/> (range roughly <x3/>–<x4/>) and First Officers at about <x5/> (range roughly <x6/>–<x7/>).</g1> That is our own estimate, not a figure ANA publishes. Where you sit inside the range is set by the aircraft type, years of service and the routes you fly.": {"es":"<g1>Estimamos que los capitanes de ANA ganan aprox. <x2/> (rango aproximado: <x3/>–<x4/>) y los primeros oficiales aprox. <x5/> (rango aproximado: <x6/>–<x7/>).</g1> Es nuestra propia estimación, no una cifra que publique ANA. La posición dentro del rango depende del tipo de aeronave, los años de servicio y las rutas que vuelas.","st":"validated","by":"ai","model":"claude-opus-5-5","pv":4,"gl":"aircraft-type:6b391c","at":"2026-11-02","pages":["en/pilot-salary-guide.html"]},
  "<g1>We estimate ANA Captains at about <x2/> and First Officers at about <x3/>.</g1> That is our own estimate, not a figure ANA publishes. The range is roughly <x4/>–<x5/> for Captains and <x6/>–<x7/> for First Officers. The only figures the company publishes are the starting monthly salaries of its own cadet program: about <x8/> a month for a master’s graduate and about <x9/> for a bachelor’s or KOSEN advanced-course graduate. <g10>See full ANA pilot salary details →</g10>": {"es":"<g1>Estimamos que los capitanes de ANA ganan alrededor de <x2/> y los primeros oficiales alrededor de <x3/>.</g1> Es una estimación propia, no una cifra publicada por ANA. El rango es aproximadamente de <x4/>–<x5/> para capitanes y de <x6/>–<x7/> para primeros oficiales. Las únicas cifras que publica la empresa son los sueldos mensuales iniciales de su propio programa de pilotos en formación: alrededor de <x8/> al mes para egresados de maestría y alrededor de <x9/> para egresados de licenciatura o del curso avanzado de un KOSEN. <g10>Ver todos los detalles del sueldo de los pilotos de ANA →</g10>","st":"validated","by":"ai","model":"claude-opus-5-5","pv":4,"gl":"cadet-trainee-pilot:67402b,pay-salary:4d4435,pilot:543af6","at":"2026-11-02","pages":["en/index.html"]},
  "<g1>We estimate JAL Captains at about <x2/> and First Officers at about <x3/> — our own estimate.</g1> The airline rebuilt its pay structure after its 2010 bankruptcy and now offers stable terms.": {"es":"<g1>Estimamos que los capitanes de JAL ganan aprox. <x2/> y los primeros oficiales aprox. <x3/> — es nuestra propia estimación.</g1> La aerolínea reestructuró su esquema de sueldos tras su quiebra de 2010 y hoy ofrece condiciones estables.","st":"validated","by":"ai","model":"claude-opus-5-5","pv":4,"gl":"airline:8a75a5,pay-salary:4d4435","at":"2026-11-02","pages":["en/pilot-salary-guide.html"]},
  "<g1>We estimate JAL Captains at about <x2/> and First Officers at about <x3/></g1> — our own estimates. JAL (Japan Airlines) operates an extensive international and domestic network, and is known for stable employment and a well-developed training system. <g4>See full JAL pilot salary details →</g4>": {"es":"<g1>Estimamos que los capitanes de JAL ganan alrededor de <x2/> y los primeros oficiales alrededor de <x3/></g1> — estimaciones propias. JAL (Japan Airlines) opera una amplia red internacional y nacional, y es conocida por la estabilidad laboral y un sistema de entrenamiento bien desarrollado. <g4>Ver todos los detalles del sueldo de los pilotos de JAL →</g4>","st":"validated","by":"ai","model":"claude-opus-5-5","pv":4,"gl":"pay-salary:4d4435,pilot:543af6","at":"2026-11-02","pages":["en/index.html"]},
  "<g1>We estimate Qatar Airways Captains at about <x2/> (range roughly <x3/>–<x4/>) and First Officers at about <x5/>.</g1> That is our own estimate from public information, not a figure Qatar Airways publishes. Based in Doha, the airline pays salaries free of income tax. It has been hiring Japanese pilots actively in recent years and is a popular destination for pilots considering a move.": {"es":"<g1>Estimamos que los capitanes de Qatar Airways ganan aprox. <x2/> (rango aproximado: <x3/>–<x4/>) y los primeros oficiales, aprox. <x5/>.</g1> Es una estimación propia a partir de información pública, no una cifra que publique Qatar Airways. Con sede en Doha, la aerolínea paga sueldos libres de impuesto sobre la renta. En los últimos años ha contratado activamente pilotos japoneses y es un destino popular entre los pilotos que consideran cambiar de aerolínea.","st":"validated","by":"ai","model":"claude-opus-5-5","pv":4,"gl":"airline:8a75a5,income-tax:02c83d","at":"2026-11-02","pages":["en/pilot-salary-guide.html"]},
  "<g1>We estimate Singapore Airlines Captains at about <x2/> (range roughly <x3/>–<x4/>) and First Officers at about <x5/>.</g1> That is our own estimate from public information, not a figure Singapore Airlines publishes. English is an official language in Singapore, and the lifestyle in Asia's financial and cultural hub is a major draw. The airline has a long track record of hiring Japanese pilots.": {"es":"<g1>Estimamos que los capitanes de Singapore Airlines ganan aprox. <x2/> (rango aproximado: <x3/>–<x4/>) y los primeros oficiales, aprox. <x5/>.</g1> Es una estimación propia a partir de información pública, no una cifra que publique Singapore Airlines. El inglés es idioma oficial en Singapur, y el estilo de vida en el centro financiero y cultural de Asia es un gran atractivo. La aerolínea tiene una larga trayectoria contratando pilotos japoneses.","st":"validated","by":"ai","model":"claude-opus-5-5","pv":4,"gl":"airline:8a75a5","at":"2026-11-02","pages":["en/pilot-salary-guide.html"]},
  "<g1>WestJet Airlines </g1>Captain<g2><g3>, estimated annual pay</g3></g2>": {"es":"Capitán de <g1>WestJet Airlines</g1><g2><g3>, sueldo anual estimado</g3></g2>","st":"validated","by":"ai","model":"claude-opus-5-5","pv":4,"gl":"annual-pay:4d3ecd,captain:2afad0,estimated-annual-pay:da013c,pay-salary:4d4435","at":"2026-11-02","pages":["en/airlines/westjet.html"]},
