  "Captain / First Officer — Domestic and international flying. Calgary-based. Key requirements: License Required: Transport Canada ATPL; English: ICAO Level 4 or above. We have not been able to confirm flight-hour requirements the airline publishes. Calgary's cost of living is lower than on the east coast.": {"es":"Capitán / Primer oficial — Vuelos nacionales e internacionales. Base en Calgary. Requisitos principales: licencia requerida: ATPL de Transport Canada; inglés: nivel 4 de la OACI o superior. No hemos podido confirmar los requisitos de horas de vuelo que publica la aerolínea. El costo de vida en Calgary es más bajo que en la costa este.","st":"validated","by":"ai","model":"claude-opus-5-5","pv":4,"gl":"airline-transport-pilot-licence:c922e1,airline:8a75a5,captain:2afad0,first-officer:9237c8,transport-commuting-allowance:375000","at":"2026-11-02","pages":["en/airlines/westjet.html"]},
  "Captain / First Officer — Domestic and international flying. Melbourne / Sydney base. Key requirements: License required: CASA ATPL; English: ICAO Level 4 or above. We have not been able to confirm flight-hour requirements the airline publishes. Internal advancement within the Qantas Group may open the possibility of transferring to Qantas mainline.": {"es":"Capitán / Primer oficial — Vuelos nacionales e internacionales. Base en Melbourne / Sydney. Requisitos principales: licencia requerida: ATPL de CASA; inglés: nivel 4 OACI o superior. No hemos podido confirmar los requisitos de horas de vuelo que publica la aerolínea. Un ascenso interno dentro del Grupo Qantas puede abrir la posibilidad de pasar a la operación principal de Qantas (mainline).","st":"validated","by":"ai","model":"claude-opus-5-5","pv":4,"gl":"airline-transport-pilot-licence:c922e1,airline:8a75a5,captain:2afad0,first-officer:9237c8","at":"2026-11-02","pages":["en/airlines/jetstar.html"]},
