  "Captain / First Officer — Domestic and international operations. Bogotá-based. Key requirements: License: ATPL (AEROCIVIL / ICAO-compliant); English: ICAO Level 4 or above. We have not been able to confirm flight-hour requirements the airline publishes; the airline’s careers page is linked under Jobs above. Bogotá is a highland city. The climate is cool and comfortable, and the cost of living is low.": {"es":"Capitán / Primer oficial — Operaciones nacionales e internacionales. Con base en Bogotá. Requisitos principales: Licencia: ATPL (AEROCIVIL / conforme a OACI); Inglés: nivel 4 OACI o superior. No hemos podido confirmar los requisitos de horas de vuelo que publica la aerolínea; la página de empleo de la aerolínea está enlazada en Empleos, más arriba. Bogotá es una ciudad de altura. El clima es fresco y agradable, y el costo de vida es bajo.","st":"validated","by":"ai","model":"claude-opus-5-5","pv":4,"gl":"airline-transport-pilot-licence:c922e1,airline:8a75a5,captain:2afad0,first-officer:9237c8","at":"2026-11-02","pages":["en/airlines/avianca.html"]},
