  "Captain, A320 (Amman, 12-month Brookfield contract, net): monthly pay <x1/>; First officer, A320 (Amman, 12-month Brookfield contract, net): monthly pay <x2/>. These are the monthly figures the airline publishes, not an annual figure divided by twelve. Twelve times the monthly figure does not equal the published annual figure, and we leave both as published. A total package that includes housing and school fees divided by twelve is not a monthly salary.": {"es":"Capitán, A320 (Amán, contrato de 12 meses con Brookfield, neto): sueldo mensual <x1/>; Primer oficial, A320 (Amán, contrato de 12 meses con Brookfield, neto): sueldo mensual <x2/>. Son las cifras mensuales que publica la aerolínea, no una cifra anual dividida entre doce. La cifra mensual multiplicada por doce no coincide con la cifra anual publicada, y dejamos ambas tal como se publicaron. Un paquete total que incluye vivienda y gastos escolares, dividido entre doce, no es un sueldo mensual.","st":"validated","by":"ai","model":"claude-opus-5-5","pv":4,"gl":"airline:8a75a5,captain:2afad0,contract:1ddc3a,first-officer:9237c8,monthly-pay:b8b477,pay-salary:4d4435","at":"2026-11-02","pages":["en/airlines/royal-jordanian.html"]},
