  "Captain, A330 (Shanghai base, 75 hours a calendar month, three-year contract): cash pay, monthly <x1/>. These are the monthly figures the airline publishes, not an annual figure divided by twelve. Twelve times the monthly figure does not equal the published annual figure, and we leave both as published. A total package that includes housing and school fees divided by twelve is not a monthly salary.": {"es":"Capitán, A330 (base en Shanghái, 75 horas por mes calendario, contrato de tres años): remuneración en efectivo, mensual <x1/>. Estas son las cifras mensuales que publica la aerolínea, no una cifra anual dividida entre doce. La cifra mensual multiplicada por doce no coincide con la cifra anual publicada, y dejamos ambas tal como se publicaron. Un paquete total que incluye vivienda y gastos escolares, dividido entre doce, no es un sueldo mensual.","st":"validated","by":"ai","model":"claude-opus-5-5","pv":4,"gl":"airline:8a75a5,captain:2afad0,contract:1ddc3a,pay-salary:4d4435","at":"2026-11-02","pages":["en/airlines/china-eastern.html"]},
