  "Captain, A330 / B787 / B777, first year (2019 agency posting, monthly): basic pay, monthly <x1/>; Same, first year (joining without the type rating): basic pay, monthly <x2/>; Same, fourth year: basic pay, monthly <x3/>. These are the monthly figures the airline publishes, not an annual figure divided by twelve. Twelve times the monthly figure does not equal the published annual figure, and we leave both as published. A total package that includes housing and school fees divided by twelve is not a monthly salary.": {"es":"Capitán, A330 / B787 / B777, primer año (anuncio de agencia de 2019, mensual): sueldo base, mensual <x1/>; Ídem, primer año (ingreso sin la habilitación de tipo): sueldo base, mensual <x2/>; Ídem, cuarto año: sueldo base, mensual <x3/>. Estas son las cifras mensuales que publica la aerolínea, no una cifra anual dividida entre doce. Doce veces la cifra mensual no equivale a la cifra anual publicada, y dejamos ambas tal como se publicaron. Un paquete total que incluye vivienda y gastos escolares dividido entre doce no es un sueldo mensual.","st":"validated","by":"ai","model":"claude-opus-5-5","pv":4,"gl":"airline:8a75a5,captain:2afad0,pay-salary:4d4435,type-rating:b7937e","at":"2026-11-02","pages":["en/airlines/china-southern.html"]},
