  "Direct Entry Captain": {"es":"Capitán de ingreso directo (Direct Entry Captain)","st":"validated","by":"ai","model":"claude-opus-5-5","pv":4,"gl":"captain:2afad0","at":"2026-11-02","pages":["pv-conditions.json"]},
  "Direct Entry Captain / First Officer — Singapore-based international operations. Key requirements: The airline’s contract vacancies ask captains for at least 7,000 hours total, including 3,000 hours PIC on international commercial jets and 1,500 hours PIC on the A350 or A380, and two years as captain on type; first officers for at least 1,500 hours as first officer (3,000 preferred), including 1,500 hours on the A350 or A380, and two years on type; both ask for ICAO English Level 5 or above. Singapore Employment Pass sponsored by SIA. Check SIA official careers for current openings.": {"es":"Capitán / primer oficial de ingreso directo (Direct Entry) — operaciones internacionales con base en Singapur. Requisitos principales: las vacantes por contrato de la aerolínea piden a los capitanes al menos 7,000 horas totales, incluidas 3,000 horas como PIC en jets comerciales internacionales y 1,500 horas como PIC en A350 o A380, y dos años como capitán en el tipo; a los primeros oficiales, al menos 1,500 horas como primer oficial (preferible 3,000), incluidas 1,500 horas en A350 o A380, y dos años en el tipo; en ambos casos piden inglés OACI nivel 5 o superior. SIA patrocina el Employment Pass de Singapur. Consulta la página oficial de empleo de SIA para ver las vacantes actuales.","st":"validated","by":"ai","model":"claude-opus-5-5","pv":4,"gl":"airline:8a75a5,captain:2afad0,contract:1ddc3a,first-officer:9237c8","at":"2026-11-02","pages":["en/airlines/singapore-airlines.html"]},
  "Direct Entry Captain — Int'l widebody. Key requirements: License: ATPL (ICAO). We have not been able to confirm flight-hour requirements the airline publishes; the airline’s careers page is linked under Jobs above.": {"es":"Capitán de ingreso directo — fuselaje ancho internacional. Requisitos clave: Licencia: ATPL (OACI). No hemos podido confirmar los requisitos de horas de vuelo que publica la aerolínea; el enlace a la página de empleo de la aerolínea está en Empleos, más arriba.","st":"validated","by":"ai","model":"claude-opus-5-5","pv":4,"gl":"airline-transport-pilot-licence:c922e1,airline:8a75a5,captain:2afad0","at":"2026-11-02","pages":["en/airlines/malaysia-airlines.html"]},
  "Direct Entry Captain — International (B777/B787/A350). Key requirements: License: ATPL (ICAO); Experience: Widebody captain; English: ICAO Level 4+.": {"es":"Capitán de ingreso directo — Internacional (B777/B787/A350). Requisitos clave: Licencia: ATPL (OACI); Experiencia: capitán en aviones de fuselaje ancho; Inglés: nivel 4+ de la OACI.","st":"validated","by":"ai","model":"claude-opus-5-5","pv":4,"gl":"airline-transport-pilot-licence:c922e1,captain:2afad0","at":"2026-11-02","pages":["en/airlines/air-india.html"]},
  "Direct employment": {"es":"Empleo directo con la aerolínea","st":"validated","by":"ai","model":"claude-opus-5-5","pv":3,"gl":"direct-employment:bb88e1","at":"2026-11-02","pages":["en/pay-report.html"]},
  "Direct entry captain": {"es":"Capitán de ingreso directo","st":"validated","by":"ai","model":"claude-opus-5-5","pv":4,"gl":"captain:2afad0","at":"2026-11-02","pages":["en/airlines/emirates.html"]},
  "Direct entry captain: cash pay, monthly <x1/>; First officer, Standard: cash pay, monthly <x2/>; First officer, Enhanced: cash pay, monthly <x3/>. These are the monthly figures the airline publishes, not an annual figure divided by twelve. Twelve times the monthly figure does not equal the published annual figure, and we leave both as published. A total package that includes housing and school fees divided by twelve is not a monthly salary.": {"es":"Capitán de ingreso directo: remuneración en efectivo, mensual <x1/>; Primer oficial, Standard: remuneración en efectivo, mensual <x2/>; Primer oficial, Enhanced: remuneración en efectivo, mensual <x3/>. Estas son las cifras mensuales que publica la aerolínea, no una cifra anual dividida entre doce. Doce veces la cifra mensual no equivale a la cifra anual publicada, y dejamos ambas tal como se publicaron. Un paquete total que incluye vivienda y gastos escolares dividido entre doce no es un sueldo mensual.","st":"validated","by":"ai","model":"claude-opus-5-5","pv":4,"gl":"airline:8a75a5,captain:2afad0,first-officer:9237c8,pay-salary:4d4435","at":"2026-11-02","pages":["en/airlines/emirates.html"]},
