  "Eurowings captains are estimated at <x1/> against <x2/> at ANA and <x3/> at JAL, and first officers <x4/> against <x5/> and <x6/>. All figures are gross, before income tax; both Germany and Japan tax pilot income.": {"es":"Se estima que los capitanes de Eurowings ganan <x1/>, frente a <x2/> en ANA y <x3/> en JAL, y los primeros oficiales <x4/>, frente a <x5/> y <x6/>. Todas las cifras son brutas, antes del impuesto sobre la renta; tanto Alemania como Japón gravan los ingresos de los pilotos.","st":"validated","by":"ai","model":"claude-opus-5-5","pv":4,"gl":"income-tax:02c83d,pilot:543af6","at":"2026-11-02","pages":["en/airlines/eurowings.html"]},
  "Eurowings captains are estimated at about <x1/> a year, before tax. Pay is set by the Vereinigung Cockpit collective agreement pay scale, so a pilot’s pay depends on their step rather than on individual negotiation.": {"es":"Se estima que los capitanes de Eurowings ganan unos <x1/> al año, antes de impuestos. La remuneración se rige por la tabla salarial (tabulador) del convenio colectivo de Vereinigung Cockpit, así que lo que gana cada piloto depende de su escalón en la tabla y no de una negociación individual.","st":"validated","by":"ai","model":"claude-opus-5-5","pv":4,"gl":"collective-agreement:c266c0,pay-salary:4d4435,pay-scale:6e4779,pilot:543af6","at":"2026-11-02","pages":["en/airlines/eurowings.html"]},
  "Eurowings first officers are estimated at about <x1/> a year, before tax. Pay moves up the first officer scale with time in seat until upgrade to captain.": {"es":"Se estima que los primeros oficiales de Eurowings ganan unos <x1/> al año, antes de impuestos. La remuneración sube en la tabla de primer oficial con el tiempo en el puesto, hasta el ascenso a capitán.","st":"validated","by":"ai","model":"claude-opus-5-5","pv":4,"gl":"captain:2afad0,first-officer:9237c8,pay-salary:4d4435","at":"2026-11-02","pages":["en/airlines/eurowings.html"]},
  "Eurowings pilot salary 2026: we estimate $174K for captains ($130K–$237K) and $108K for first officers ($80K–$135K). Fleet, hiring requirements and pilot reviews.": {"es":"Sueldo de pilotos de Eurowings 2026: estimamos $174 mil para capitanes ($130 mil–$237 mil) y $108 mil para primeros oficiales ($80 mil–$135 mil). Flota, requisitos de contratación y reseñas de pilotos.","st":"validated","by":"ai","model":"claude-opus-5-5","pv":4,"gl":"fleet:56d21e,pay-salary:4d4435,pilot:543af6","at":"2026-11-02","pages":["en/airlines/eurowings.html"]},
