  "First Officer (Direct Entry) — Frankfurt / Munich base. Key requirements: License: EASA ATPL or equivalent; We have not been able to confirm flight-hour requirements the airline publishes. Apply via Lufthansa Group careers.": {"es":"Primer oficial (ingreso directo) — base Frankfurt / Múnich. Requisitos principales: Licencia: ATPL EASA o equivalente; no hemos podido confirmar los requisitos de horas de vuelo que publica la aerolínea. Postúlate a través del portal de empleo de Lufthansa Group.","st":"validated","by":"ai","model":"claude-opus-5-5","pv":4,"gl":"airline-transport-pilot-licence:c922e1,airline:8a75a5,first-officer:9237c8","at":"2026-11-02","pages":["en/airlines/lufthansa.html"]},
  "First Officer (F/O) — Airbus A320 — EASA license holders; low-hour and non-type-rated pilots welcome. Key requirements: Requirements: Valid EASA Instrument Rating (IR); Type Rating: A320 type rating (not required to apply); Employment Type: Contract (Contract/Freelancer); Apply To: info@eaglejet.com.": {"es":"Primer oficial (F/O) — Airbus A320 — titulares de licencia EASA; son bienvenidos pilotos con pocas horas y sin habilitación de tipo. Requisitos clave: Requisitos: habilitación de vuelo por instrumentos (IR) EASA vigente; Habilitación de tipo: habilitación de tipo A320 (no es necesaria para postularse); Tipo de empleo: por contrato (contrato / independiente); Envía tu postulación a: info@eaglejet.com.","st":"validated","by":"ai","model":"claude-opus-5-5","pv":4,"gl":"contract:1ddc3a,first-officer:9237c8,type-rating:b7937e","at":"2026-11-02","pages":["en/airlines/eagle-jet.html"]},
  "First Officer (F/O) — Embraer Lineage 1000 (EMB170/190) — European private charter operations. Key requirements: Required license: Valid EASA CPL/ATPL; Type rating: EMB170/190 type rating (preferred); Employment: Full-time (permanent).": {"es":"Primer oficial (F/O) — Embraer Lineage 1000 (EMB170/190) — operaciones chárter privadas en Europa. Requisitos principales: Licencia requerida: CPL/ATPL EASA vigente; Habilitación de tipo: habilitación de tipo EMB170/190 (deseable); Empleo: tiempo completo (contrato indefinido).","st":"validated","by":"ai","model":"claude-opus-5-5","pv":4,"gl":"airline-transport-pilot-licence:c922e1,commercial-pilot-licence:b6b622,first-officer:9237c8,type-rating:b7937e","at":"2026-11-02","pages":["en/airlines/airx-charter.html"]},
