  "If it varies by seniority or contract, your own current entitlement is fine.": {"es":"Si varía según la antigüedad o el contrato, basta con los días que te corresponden actualmente.","st":"validated","by":"ai","model":"claude-opus-5-5","pv":4,"gl":"contract:1ddc3a,seniority:b57888","at":"2026-11-02","pages":["pv-conditions.json"]},
  "If you already hold a pilot license and have logged flight hours, you can move to another airline through <g1>experienced-hire recruitment</g1>. Moves from the Japan Self-Defense Forces and the Ministry of Defense are common, and military flying experience is highly regarded in the civil sector. Requirements are often 1,500–5,000 flight hours or more.": {"es":"Si ya tienes licencia de piloto y horas de vuelo registradas, puedes pasar a otra aerolínea mediante la <g1>contratación de pilotos con experiencia</g1>. Son frecuentes los traslados desde las Fuerzas de Autodefensa de Japón y el Ministerio de Defensa, y la experiencia de vuelo militar es muy valorada en el sector civil. Los requisitos suelen ser de 1,500–5,000 horas de vuelo o más.","st":"validated","by":"ai","model":"claude-opus-5-5","pv":4,"gl":"airline:8a75a5,flight-time-flight-hours:a387d6,pilot:543af6,sector-leg:a52ec6","at":"2026-11-02","pages":["en/pilot-salary-guide.html"]},
  "If you answer questions or add a hotel, restaurant, place or town without signing in, a key that lets only your device see your own posts is stored in this browser (the server keeps only an irreversible value made from it). To count additions from one connection, a value derived from your IP address is kept for one day and then deleted. We do not ask for an e-mail address, a name or a location.": {"es":"Si respondes preguntas o agregas un hotel, restaurante, lugar o ciudad sin iniciar sesión, en este navegador se guarda una clave que permite que solo tu dispositivo vea tus propias publicaciones (el servidor solo conserva un valor irreversible generado a partir de ella). Para contar las adiciones desde una misma conexión, se conserva durante un día un valor derivado de tu dirección IP y luego se elimina. No te pedimos correo electrónico, nombre ni ubicación.","st":"validated","by":"ai","model":"claude-opus-5-5","pv":3,"gl":"","at":"2026-11-02","pages":["en/personal-data.html"]},
  "If you contribute 6%, the company contributes 15% (British Airways Pension Plan)": {"es":"Si aportas el 6%, la empresa aporta el 15% (British Airways Pension Plan)","st":"validated","by":"ai","model":"claude-opus-5-5","pv":4,"gl":"","at":"2026-11-02","pages":["en/airlines/british-airways.html"]},
  "If you resign within 24 months of completing type-rating training, you repay the share for the remaining months": {"es":"Si renuncias dentro de los 24 meses siguientes a terminar la formación de habilitación de tipo, devuelves la parte correspondiente a los meses restantes","st":"validated","by":"ai","model":"claude-opus-5-5","pv":4,"gl":"","at":"2026-11-02","pages":["en/airlines/norwegian.html"]},
  "If you wish to have your data deleted or disclosed to you, please contact us via the withdrawal request form on your profile page or the inquiry form on the community page. We will respond promptly once we have verified your identity.": {"es":"Si quieres solicitar la eliminación de tus datos o el acceso a ellos, contáctanos mediante el formulario de solicitud de baja en tu página de perfil o el formulario de consultas en la página de la comunidad. Te responderemos a la brevedad una vez que hayamos verificado tu identidad.","st":"validated","by":"ai","model":"claude-opus-5-5","pv":3,"gl":"verify-verified:9f917a","at":"2026-11-02","pages":["en/personal-data.html"]},
