  "Istanbul Sabiha Gokcen": {"es":"Estambul Sabiha Gokcen","st":"validated","by":"ai","model":"claude-opus-5-5","pv":4,"gl":"","at":"2026-11-02","pages":["en/airlines/kuwait-airways.html"]},
  "Istanbul · Auckland": {"es":"Estambul · Auckland","st":"validated","by":"ai","model":"claude-opus-5-5","pv":4,"gl":"","at":"2026-11-02","pages":["en/airlines/eva-air.html"]},
  "It applies from the first line flight, with allowances and subsidies calculated separately.": {"es":"Se aplica desde el primer vuelo de línea, y las asignaciones y ayudas se calculan aparte.","st":"validated","by":"ai","model":"claude-opus-5-5","pv":4,"gl":"","at":"2026-11-02","pages":["en/airlines/eva-air.html"]},
  "It applies only to the initial training period after joining, not to later stages.": {"es":"Aplica solo al periodo de formación inicial tras el ingreso, no a etapas posteriores.","st":"validated","by":"ai","model":"claude-opus-5-5","pv":4,"gl":"","at":"2026-11-02","pages":["en/airlines/j-air.html"]},
  "It applies to trainees before they hold a license, on an initial two-year fixed-term contract. It is not a figure for captains or first officers.": {"es":"Se aplica a pilotos en formación que aún no tienen licencia, con un contrato inicial a plazo fijo de dos años. No es una cifra para capitanes ni primeros oficiales.","st":"validated","by":"ai","model":"claude-opus-5-5","pv":4,"gl":"contract:1ddc3a,fixed-term-contract:e51ebe","at":"2026-11-02","pages":["en/airlines/peach.html"]},
  "It assumes 75 hours per calendar month, a Shanghai base, a three-year renewable contract, 21 days on and 10 days off, and 15 days of annual leave. The requirements are an A330 type rating and 5,500 hours of PIC time, of which 500 hours on type.": {"es":"Supone 75 horas por mes calendario, base en Shanghái, un contrato de tres años renovable, 21 días de servicio y 10 días libres, y 15 días de vacaciones. Los requisitos son la habilitación de tipo de A330 y 5,500 horas como PIC, de las cuales 500 horas en el tipo.","st":"validated","by":"ai","model":"claude-opus-5-5","pv":4,"gl":"annual-leave:0ecaeb,contract:1ddc3a,days-off:2d86cd,type-rating:b7937e","at":"2026-11-02","pages":["en/airlines/china-eastern.html"]},
  "It assumes 80 block hours a month, a Guangzhou base and a four-year renewable contract. The posting does not say whether the figure is before or after tax.": {"es":"Supone 80 horas block (calzo a calzo) al mes, base en Guangzhou y un contrato renovable de cuatro años. El anuncio no indica si la cifra es antes o después de impuestos.","st":"validated","by":"ai","model":"claude-opus-5-5","pv":4,"gl":"block-hours-block-time:8db174,contract:1ddc3a","at":"2026-11-02","pages":["en/airlines/china-southern.html"]},
  "It depends on your training route. Company-sponsored cadets typically line up as First Officers 3–4 years after being hired. Via the Civil Aviation College it is 2 years of university plus 2 years of training, 4 years in total. Self-funded training at an overseas school takes 1.5–2 years to license, after which you begin your job search.": {"es":"Depende de tu ruta de formación. Los pilotos en formación patrocinados por la aerolínea suelen empezar a volar en línea como primeros oficiales 3–4 años después de ser contratados. A través de la Escuela de Aviación Civil (Civil Aviation College) son 2 años de universidad más 2 años de formación, 4 años en total. La formación autofinanciada en una escuela en el extranjero toma 1.5–2 años hasta obtener la licencia; después empiezas a buscar trabajo.","st":"validated","by":"ai","model":"claude-opus-5-5","pv":4,"gl":"","at":"2026-11-02","pages":["en/pilot-salary-guide.html"]},
  "It is a contract for foreign pilots, with commuting flights and six return tickets a year for the family.": {"es":"Es un contrato para pilotos extranjeros, con vuelos para desplazarse a la base y seis boletos de ida y vuelta al año para la familia.","st":"validated","by":"ai","model":"claude-opus-5-5","pv":4,"gl":"contract:1ddc3a","at":"2026-11-02","pages":["en/airlines/china-southern.html"]},
