  "On Burrard Inlet's north shore, linked to downtown Vancouver by the Lions Gate Bridge, with homes rising from the water up the mountainside.": {"es":"En la orilla norte de Burrard Inlet, unido al centro de Vancouver por el Lions Gate Bridge, con casas que suben desde el agua por la ladera de la montaña.","st":"validated","by":"ai","model":"claude-opus-5-5","pv":4,"gl":"","at":"2026-11-03","pages":["en/airlines/westjet.html"]},
  "On Philadelphia’s western edge along the Main Line, a mostly single-family area with Bala Avenue’s theater, small shops and restaurants.": {"es":"En el límite oeste de Filadelfia, a lo largo de la Main Line, una zona principalmente de casas unifamiliares con el teatro, pequeñas tiendas y restaurantes de Bala Avenue.","st":"validated","by":"ai","model":"claude-opus-5-5","pv":4,"gl":"","at":"2026-11-03","pages":["en/airlines/american.html"]},
  "On San Diego Bay, halfway between downtown San Diego and Tijuana; its Spanish name means 'beautiful view', and it has a bayfront marina.": {"es":"A orillas de la bahía de San Diego, a medio camino entre el centro de San Diego y Tijuana; su nombre en español significa 'vista hermosa' y tiene una marina frente a la bahía.","st":"validated","by":"ai","model":"claude-opus-5-5","pv":4,"gl":"","at":"2026-11-03","pages":["en/airlines/alaska-airlines.html"]},
  "On duties with a night away from base, the company provides accommodation and transport between the airport and the accommodation": {"es":"En servicios con pernocta fuera de base, la empresa proporciona el alojamiento y el traslado entre el aeropuerto y el alojamiento","st":"validated","by":"ai","model":"claude-opus-5-5","pv":4,"gl":"standby:08030a,transport-commuting-allowance:375000","at":"2026-11-02","pages":["en/airlines/qantas.html"]},
  "On layovers the company provides the hotel and transport": {"es":"En las pernoctas, la empresa proporciona el hotel y el transporte","st":"validated","by":"ai","model":"claude-opus-5-5","pv":4,"gl":"transport-commuting-allowance:375000","at":"2026-11-02","pages":["en/airlines/sas.html"]},
  "On raw salary, Captains at the US majors (Delta, United, American Airlines) top the list; our estimate puts them at <x1/>–<x2/> with a range topping out at <x3/>. Hiring there is restricted for foreign nationals, however. Among airlines open to foreign pilots, the one that publishes its own figure is Emirates, whose Captain cash pay is about <x4/> a year (Direct Entry posting), with a total package of about <x5/> a year — both tax-free. We estimate Qatar Airways Captains at about <x6/> and Singapore Airlines Captains at about <x7/>.": {"es":"Solo por sueldo, los capitanes de las grandes aerolíneas de EE. UU. (Delta, United, American Airlines) encabezan la lista; nuestra estimación los sitúa en <x1/>–<x2/>, con un rango que llega hasta <x3/>. Sin embargo, la contratación de extranjeros en esas aerolíneas está restringida. Entre las aerolíneas abiertas a pilotos extranjeros, la que publica su propia cifra es Emirates: la remuneración en efectivo de sus capitanes es de aprox. <x4/> al año (oferta de ingreso directo), con un paquete total de aprox. <x5/> al año — ambos libres de impuestos. Estimamos que los capitanes de Qatar Airways perciben aprox. <x6/> y los de Singapore Airlines, aprox. <x7/>.","st":"validated","by":"ai","model":"claude-opus-5-5","pv":4,"gl":"captain:2afad0,pay-salary:4d4435","at":"2026-11-02","pages":["en/pilot-salary-guide.html"]},
  "On short en-route stops (MEM, IND, etc.), sleep rooms can replace hotels under set conditions": {"es":"En paradas intermedias cortas (MEM, IND, etc.), las habitaciones para dormir pueden sustituir al hotel en condiciones establecidas","st":"validated","by":"ai","model":"claude-opus-5-5","pv":4,"gl":"","at":"2026-11-03","pages":["en/airlines/fedex-express.html"]},
  "On the Columbia River's north bank, directly north of Portland; founded around Fort Vancouver in 1825, with a redeveloped waterfront.": {"es":"En la orilla norte del río Columbia, justo al norte de Portland; fundada alrededor de Fort Vancouver en 1825, con un frente ribereño renovado.","st":"validated","by":"ai","model":"claude-opus-5-5","pv":4,"gl":"","at":"2026-11-03","pages":["en/airlines/alaska-airlines.html"]},
