  "Pay recorded by pilots themselves, one row per pilot. Several months from the same pilot fold into a single row, and every figure is rounded to two significant digits.": {"es":"Remuneración registrada por los propios pilotos, una fila por piloto. Varios meses de un mismo piloto se agrupan en una sola fila y todos los valores se redondean a dos cifras significativas.","st":"validated","by":"ai","model":"claude-opus-5-5","pv":3,"gl":"pay-salary:4d4435,pilot:543af6","at":"2026-11-02","pages":["en/actual-pay.html"]},
