  "Pick your tax residence and we fill in <g1>a rough rate</g1> (Japan, the UK, the US, and countries with no income tax). Overwrite it with the figure on your payslip. You can leave it blank.": {"es":"Elige tu residencia fiscal y completamos <g1>una tasa aproximada</g1> (Japón, Reino Unido, EE. UU. y países sin impuesto sobre la renta). Reemplázala por la cifra de tu recibo de nómina. Puedes dejarla en blanco.","st":"validated","by":"ai","model":"claude-opus-5-5","pv":1,"gl":"income-tax:02c83d,payslip:c09b58,tax-residence:9f1526","at":"2026-11-02","pages":["en/pay-report.html"]},
