  "Saudi Arabia": {"es":"Arabia Saudita","st":"validated","by":"ai","model":"claude-opus-5-5","pv":3,"gl":"","at":"2026-11-02","pages":["en/pay-report.html"]},
  "Saudi Arabia levies no personal income tax, so pay is effectively take-home. The 2005 advert itself says \"12.3 months tax free salary\". On our estimate captains are at about <x1/> a year and first officers about <x2/>, and with no income tax that is close to what reaches your account. Your own residency and tax position needs separate advice.": {"es":"Arabia Saudita no cobra impuesto sobre la renta a personas físicas, así que la remuneración es prácticamente neta. El propio anuncio de 2005 dice \"12.3 meses de sueldo libre de impuestos\". Según nuestra estimación, los capitanes rondan <x1/> al año y los primeros oficiales unos <x2/>, y sin impuesto sobre la renta eso se acerca a lo que llega a tu cuenta. Tu propia residencia fiscal y situación tributaria requieren asesoría aparte.","st":"validated","by":"ai","model":"claude-opus-5-5","pv":4,"gl":"income-tax:02c83d,pay-salary:4d4435,rank-position:a04160,standby:08030a","at":"2026-11-02","pages":["en/airlines/saudia.html"]},
  "Saudia (Saudi Arabian Airlines, own site), “Advert – Captains”": {"es":"Saudia (Saudi Arabian Airlines, sitio web propio), “Advert – Captains”","st":"validated","by":"ai","model":"claude-opus-5-5","pv":4,"gl":"","at":"2026-11-02","pages":["en/airlines/saudia.html"]},
