  "Saudia Airlines “Saudia Advancing Saudi Vision 2030 with Major Milestones”": {"es":"Saudia Airlines “Saudia Advancing Saudi Vision 2030 with Major Milestones”","st":"validated","by":"ai","model":"claude-opus-5-5","pv":4,"gl":"","at":"2026-11-02","pages":["en/airlines/saudia.html"]},
  "Saudia Boeing 787-9": {"es":"Boeing 787-9 de Saudia","st":"validated","by":"ai","model":"claude-opus-5-5","pv":4,"gl":"","at":"2026-11-02","pages":["en/airlines/saudia.html"]},
  "Saudia Pilot Salary 2026 — 2005 Advert $5.2K/Month | PILOT VALUE": {"es":"Sueldo de pilotos de Saudia 2026 — anuncio de 2005: US$5.2 mil/mes | PILOT VALUE","st":"validated","by":"ai","model":"claude-opus-5-5","pv":4,"gl":"pay-salary:4d4435,pilot:543af6","at":"2026-11-02","pages":["en/airlines/saudia.html"]},
  "Saudia captains earn about <x1/> a year on our estimate, and Saudi Arabia levies no personal income tax, so that is close to take-home. The airline's own figure is the Monthly Base Pay printed in a 2005 advert on its own site: SAR 19,587 a month (about <x2/>) for a B747 Classic / MD-11 captain and SAR 16,107 (about <x3/>) for an EMB170 captain. The airline itself lists 21 further items as benefits \"over and above Base pay\", so they are not in that figure. It is a 2005 advert, not current pay. Source checked on 2026-09-29.": {"es":"Según nuestra estimación, los capitanes de Saudia ganan alrededor de <x1/> al año, y Arabia Saudita no cobra impuesto sobre la renta a personas físicas, así que eso se acerca al sueldo neto. La cifra de la propia aerolínea es el sueldo base mensual (Monthly Base Pay) publicado en un anuncio de 2005 en su propio sitio: SAR 19,587 al mes (unos <x2/>) para un capitán de B747 Classic / MD-11 y SAR 16,107 (unos <x3/>) para un capitán de EMB170. La propia aerolínea enumera otros 21 conceptos como prestaciones \"por encima del sueldo base\", así que no están incluidos en esa cifra. Es un anuncio de 2005, no la remuneración actual. Fuente consultada el 2026-09-29.","st":"validated","by":"ai","model":"claude-opus-5-5","pv":4,"gl":"airline:8a75a5,base-pay-basic-salary:bea199,captain:2afad0,income-tax:02c83d,pay-salary:4d4435,standby:08030a","at":"2026-11-02","pages":["en/airlines/saudia.html"]},
  "Saudia first officers earn about <x1/> a year on our estimate, and Saudi Arabia levies no personal income tax, so that is close to take-home. The airline's own figure is the Monthly Base Pay printed in a 2005 advert: SAR 13,475 a month (about <x2/>) for a B747 Classic / MD-11 first officer. The 21 further items the airline lists separately are not in that figure. It is a 2005 advert, not current pay.": {"es":"Según nuestra estimación, los primeros oficiales de Saudia ganan alrededor de <x1/> al año, y Arabia Saudita no cobra impuesto sobre la renta a personas físicas, así que eso se acerca al sueldo neto. La cifra de la propia aerolínea es el sueldo base mensual (Monthly Base Pay) publicado en un anuncio de 2005: SAR 13,475 al mes (unos <x2/>) para un primer oficial de B747 Classic / MD-11. Los otros 21 conceptos que la aerolínea enumera por separado no están incluidos en esa cifra. Es un anuncio de 2005, no la remuneración actual.","st":"validated","by":"ai","model":"claude-opus-5-5","pv":4,"gl":"airline:8a75a5,base-pay-basic-salary:bea199,first-officer:9237c8,income-tax:02c83d,pay-salary:4d4435,standby:08030a","at":"2026-11-02","pages":["en/airlines/saudia.html"]},
  "Saudia pilot pay on our estimate: captains about $208K a year, first officers about $113K, tax-free. Its own 2005 advert shows monthly basic pay of about $5.2K.": {"es":"Remuneración de pilotos de Saudia según nuestra estimación: capitanes, unos US$208 mil al año; primeros oficiales, unos US$113 mil, libres de impuestos. Su propio anuncio de 2005 muestra un sueldo base mensual de unos US$5.2 mil.","st":"validated","by":"ai","model":"claude-opus-5-5","pv":4,"gl":"pay-salary:4d4435,pilot:543af6","at":"2026-11-02","pages":["en/airlines/saudia.html"]},
