  "The Target Annual Salary is what the airline says you reach if you fly its target block hours. It is not a guaranteed amount.": {"es":"El sueldo anual objetivo (Target Annual Salary) es lo que la aerolínea dice que alcanzas si vuelas su objetivo de horas block (calzo a calzo). No es un monto garantizado.","st":"validated","by":"ai","model":"claude-opus-5-5","pv":4,"gl":"airline:8a75a5,block-hours-block-time:8db174,pay-salary:4d4435","at":"2026-11-02","pages":["en/airlines/cathay-pacific.html"]},
  "The Times of India, “Past tense, eye on future: Air India hikes pilots’ pay by 8% to 15%”": {"es":"The Times of India, “Past tense, eye on future: Air India hikes pilots’ pay by 8% to 15%”","st":"validated","by":"ai","model":"claude-opus-5-5","pv":4,"gl":"pay-salary:4d4435","at":"2026-11-02","pages":["en/airlines/air-india.html"]},
  "The US majors top the pilot salary rankings. We estimate Delta Air Lines Captains at about $454K (range $374K–$563K), American Airlines at about $427K and United Airlines at about $402K. In the Middle East, Emirates posts a Direct Entry Captain cash salary of about $157K a year, tax-free. We estimate Captains at about $179K at ANA and $161K at JAL, and Qatar Airways Captains at about $250K. Our estimates are not figures the airlines publish.": {"es":"Las grandes aerolíneas de EE. UU. encabezan el ranking de sueldos de pilotos. Estimamos que los capitanes de Delta Air Lines ganan unos 454 mil USD (rango: 374 mil–563 mil USD), los de American Airlines unos 427 mil USD y los de United Airlines unos 402 mil USD. En Medio Oriente, Emirates publica un sueldo en efectivo de capitán de ingreso directo (Direct Entry Captain) de unos 157 mil USD al año, libre de impuestos. Estimamos que los capitanes ganan unos 179 mil USD en ANA y 161 mil USD en JAL, y que los capitanes de Qatar Airways ganan unos 250 mil USD. Nuestras estimaciones no son cifras publicadas por las aerolíneas.","st":"validated","by":"ai","model":"claude-opus-5-5","pv":4,"gl":"captain:2afad0,pay-salary:4d4435,pilot:543af6","at":"2026-11-02","pages":["en/pilot-salary-guide.html"]},
  "The United Arab Emirates has no personal income tax, so the cash pay Emirates quotes is received with no income tax deducted. Japanese airline salaries are quoted before tax is taken off, so the same headline figure leaves a different amount in hand. The ANA and JAL figures on this site are our own estimates, while Emirates quotes a figure from its own posting, so we do not publish a multiple between them. Your own tax position, Japanese residency in particular, needs checking separately.": {"es":"Los Emiratos Árabes Unidos no tienen impuesto sobre la renta personal, así que la remuneración en efectivo que indica Emirates se recibe sin que se descuente impuesto sobre la renta. Los sueldos de las aerolíneas japonesas se expresan antes de descontar impuestos, por lo que una misma cifra principal deja un monto distinto en el bolsillo. Las cifras de ANA y JAL en este sitio son estimaciones propias, mientras que Emirates indica una cifra de su propia oferta de empleo, así que no publicamos cuántas veces una cifra supera a la otra. Tu situación fiscal, en particular la residencia en Japón, debe revisarse por separado.","st":"validated","by":"ai","model":"claude-opus-5-5","pv":4,"gl":"airline:8a75a5,income-tax:02c83d,pay-salary:4d4435,rank-position:a04160","at":"2026-11-02","pages":["en/airlines/emirates.html"]},
  "The Visionary<g1>Tung Chung</g1>": {"es":"The Visionary<g1>Tung Chung</g1>","st":"validated","by":"ai","model":"claude-opus-5-5","pv":4,"gl":"","at":"2026-11-02","pages":["en/airlines/cathay-pacific.html"]},
