  "The cost of initial training (OCC) falls in steps from the full amount depending on when you leave, and nothing is repaid after two years": {"es":"El costo de la formación inicial (OCC) disminuye de forma escalonada desde el monto total según cuándo dejes la empresa, y después de dos años no se devuelve nada","st":"validated","by":"ai","model":"claude-opus-5-5","pv":4,"gl":"","at":"2026-11-02","pages":["en/airlines/easyjet.html"]},
