  "This is a 2017 advert, and the page itself says applications have closed. It is not a current figure.": {"es":"Es un anuncio de 2017 y la propia página indica que la convocatoria está cerrada. No es una cifra actual.","st":"validated","by":"ai","model":"claude-opus-5-5","pv":4,"gl":"","at":"2026-11-02","pages":["en/airlines/oman-air.html"]},
  "This is not salary. The airline calls it a \"challenge allowance\" and says it is paid for about 24 months to support living costs during overseas training.": {"es":"Esto no es un sueldo. La aerolínea lo llama \"asignación Challenge\" y dice que se paga durante unos 24 meses para ayudar con los gastos de manutención mientras dura la formación en el extranjero.","st":"validated","by":"ai","model":"claude-opus-5-5","pv":4,"gl":"airline:8a75a5,allowance:8e7744,pay-salary:4d4435","at":"2026-11-02","pages":["en/airlines/peach.html"]},
  "This is what will be posted. It contains nothing that can identify you personally.": {"es":"Esto es lo que se publicará. No contiene nada que pueda identificarte personalmente.","st":"validated","by":"ai","model":"claude-opus-5-5","pv":4,"gl":"","at":"2026-11-02","pages":["en/submit-review.html"]},
  "This route takes you through the national Civil Aviation College (Miyazaki and Obihiro) and on to an airline. Tuition is far lower than at a self-funded school, and the college has a strong record of placing graduates with Japanese airlines. Competition is stiff, but the intake is wider than for company-sponsored cadet programs.": {"es":"Esta ruta te lleva por la Escuela de Aviación Civil nacional (Civil Aviation College), con sedes en Miyazaki y Obihiro, y de ahí a una aerolínea. El costo de los estudios es mucho más bajo que en una escuela de vuelo autofinanciada, y la escuela tiene un sólido historial de colocación de egresados en aerolíneas japonesas. La competencia es dura, pero el cupo de ingreso es más amplio que en los programas de pilotos en formación patrocinados por las aerolíneas.","st":"validated","by":"ai","model":"claude-opus-5-5","pv":4,"gl":"airline:8a75a5,cadet-trainee-pilot:67402b","at":"2026-11-02","pages":["en/pilot-salary-guide.html"]},
