  "Upgrading from First Officer (F/O) to Captain (PIC) is the single biggest turning point in a pilot's career. The impact on pay varies by airline, but you can generally expect an <g1>increase of <x2/>–<x3/> on upgrade</g1>.": {"es":"Ascender de primer oficial (F/O) a capitán (PIC) es el mayor punto de inflexión en la carrera de un piloto. El impacto en el sueldo varía según la aerolínea, pero en general puedes esperar un <g1>aumento de <x2/>–<x3/> con el ascenso</g1>.","st":"validated","by":"ai","model":"claude-opus-5-5","pv":4,"gl":"airline:8a75a5,captain:2afad0,first-officer:9237c8,pay-salary:4d4435,pilot:543af6","at":"2026-11-02","pages":["en/pilot-salary-guide.html"]},
  "Upgrading from First Officer to Captain generally takes 10–15 years. At ANA and JAL you build 5,000–8,000 flight hours as a First Officer before command training and upgrade. At overseas airlines such as Emirates, upgrade in 5–8 years is possible.": {"es":"El ascenso de primer oficial a capitán suele tomar 10–15 años. En ANA y JAL acumulas 5,000–8,000 horas de vuelo como primer oficial antes de la formación para capitán y el ascenso. En aerolíneas extranjeras como Emirates, es posible ascender en 5–8 años.","st":"validated","by":"ai","model":"claude-opus-5-5","pv":4,"gl":"captain:2afad0,first-officer:9237c8,flight-time-flight-hours:a387d6","at":"2026-11-02","pages":["en/pilot-salary-guide.html"]},
  "Upper St. Clair": {"es":"Upper St. Clair","st":"validated","by":"ai","model":"claude-opus-5-5","pv":4,"gl":"","at":"2026-11-03","pages":["en/airlines/allegiant.html"]},
  "Upper St. Clair<g1>PA 15241</g1>": {"es":"Upper St. Clair<g1>PA 15241</g1>","st":"validated","by":"ai","model":"claude-opus-5-5","pv":4,"gl":"","at":"2026-11-03","pages":["en/airlines/allegiant.html"]},
