  "We have not been able to confirm sources for fares or travel times": {"es":"No hemos podido confirmar fuentes sobre tarifas ni tiempos de traslado","st":"validated","by":"ai","model":"claude-opus-5-5","pv":4,"gl":"","at":"2026-11-02","pages":["en/airlines/vueling.html"]},
  "We have not been able to confirm sources for travel times and transport to the airport": {"es":"No hemos podido confirmar fuentes sobre los tiempos de traslado ni el transporte al aeropuerto","st":"validated","by":"ai","model":"claude-opus-5-5","pv":4,"gl":"standby:08030a,transport-commuting-allowance:375000","at":"2026-11-02","pages":["en/airlines/vueling.html"]},
  "We have not been able to verify a current requirement set. The 2017 advert asked captains for 5,000 hours in command of multi-crew aircraft plus 500 hours on type, age 25 to 54, and ICAO English Level 4 or above; first officers for 1,500 hours on multi-crew aircraft plus 300 hours on type, under 46, and ICAO English Level 4 or above. That advert is closed and those figures are not current requirements.": {"es":"No hemos podido verificar los requisitos vigentes. El anuncio de 2017 pedía a los capitanes 5,000 horas al mando en aeronaves multitripulación más 500 horas en el tipo, edad de 25 a 54 años e inglés OACI nivel 4 o superior; a los primeros oficiales, 1,500 horas en aeronaves multitripulación más 300 horas en el tipo, menos de 46 años e inglés OACI nivel 4 o superior. Ese anuncio está cerrado y esas cifras no son requisitos vigentes.","st":"validated","by":"ai","model":"claude-opus-5-5","pv":4,"gl":"verify-verified:9f917a","at":"2026-11-02","pages":["en/airlines/oman-air.html"]},
  "We have not verified a current requirement set. The 2005 advert states that applicants must be under 53 (53 to 55 requires the relevant FAA type rating), that the contract is three years and renewable, and that guaranteed monthly flying hours are 65 to 75 depending on aircraft group. Those are the conditions of a 2005 advert, not current requirements.": {"es":"No hemos verificado un conjunto de requisitos vigente. El anuncio de 2005 indica que los aspirantes deben tener menos de 53 años (de 53 a 55 se requiere la habilitación de tipo FAA correspondiente), que el contrato es de tres años y renovable, y que las horas de vuelo garantizadas al mes son de 65 a 75 según el grupo de aeronave. Son las condiciones de un anuncio de 2005, no requisitos actuales.","st":"validated","by":"ai","model":"claude-opus-5-5","pv":4,"gl":"contract:1ddc3a,type-rating:b7937e,verify-verified:9f917a","at":"2026-11-02","pages":["en/airlines/saudia.html"]},
  "We only ask for a 10-year band.": {"es":"Solo pedimos un rango de 10 años.","st":"validated","by":"ai","model":"claude-opus-5-5","pv":3,"gl":"","at":"2026-11-02","pages":["en/pay-report.html"]},
  "We send you useful updates such as salary data refreshes, new reviews and newly added airlines. We never send advertising.": {"es":"Te enviamos novedades útiles, como datos de remuneración actualizados, nuevas reseñas y aerolíneas recién agregadas. Nunca enviamos publicidad.","st":"validated","by":"ai","model":"claude-opus-5-5","pv":3,"gl":"pay-salary:4d4435","at":"2026-11-02","pages":["en/profile.html"]},
