  "What pilots actually earn, from 119 airlines' data: the captain–first officer gap, how pay grows by fleet and seniority, and take-home at home vs overseas carriers.": {"es":"Lo que realmente ganan los pilotos, según datos de 119 aerolíneas: la diferencia entre capitán y primer oficial, cómo aumenta la remuneración según la flota y la antigüedad, y el sueldo neto en aerolíneas japonesas frente a extranjeras.","st":"validated","by":"ai","model":"claude-opus-5-5","pv":4,"gl":"captain:2afad0,first-officer:9237c8,fleet:56d21e,pay-salary:4d4435,seniority:b57888,standby:08030a","at":"2026-11-02","pages":["en/pilot-salary-guide.html"]},
  "What pilots actually earn, from 124 airlines' data: the captain–first officer gap, how pay grows by fleet and seniority, and take-home at home vs overseas carriers.": {"es":"Lo que ganan realmente los pilotos, según datos de 124 aerolíneas: la diferencia entre capitán y primer oficial, cómo aumenta el sueldo según la flota y la antigüedad, y el sueldo neto en aerolíneas japonesas frente a extranjeras.","st":"validated","by":"ai","model":"claude-opus-5-5","pv":4,"gl":"captain:2afad0,first-officer:9237c8,fleet:56d21e,pay-salary:4d4435,seniority:b57888,standby:08030a","at":"2026-11-03","pages":["en/pilot-salary-guide.html"]},
  "What reached your account after tax and deductions (“Net Pay”).": {"es":"Lo que llegó a tu cuenta después de impuestos y deducciones (“Net Pay”).","st":"validated","by":"ai","model":"claude-opus-5-5","pv":3,"gl":"deductions:5a7943,net-pay:6e15fc,pay-salary:4d4435","at":"2026-11-02","pages":["en/pay-report.html"]},
  "What stands out is the <g1>gap between overseas and domestic pay</g1>. Senior Captains at the US majors can clear <x2/> a year. We estimate ANA Captains at about <x3/> and First Officers at about <x4/>, and JAL Captains at about <x5/> and First Officers at about <x6/>. Emirates posts a Direct Entry Captain cash salary of about <x7/> a year, and because the UAE levies no personal income tax that cash salary is what you keep. We estimate Qatar Airways Captains at about <x8/> and First Officers at about <x9/>.": {"es":"Lo que más destaca es la <g1>diferencia entre los sueldos en el extranjero y los de Japón</g1>. Los capitanes sénior de las grandes aerolíneas de EE. UU. pueden superar <x2/> al año. Estimamos que los capitanes de ANA ganan aprox. <x3/> y los primeros oficiales aprox. <x4/>, y que los capitanes de JAL ganan aprox. <x5/> y los primeros oficiales aprox. <x6/>. Emirates publica para capitán de ingreso directo (Direct Entry) un sueldo en efectivo de aprox. <x7/> al año y, como los EAU no cobran impuesto sobre la renta a personas físicas, ese sueldo en efectivo es lo que te quedas. Estimamos que los capitanes de Qatar Airways ganan aprox. <x8/> y los primeros oficiales aprox. <x9/>.","st":"validated","by":"ai","model":"claude-opus-5-5","pv":4,"gl":"captain:2afad0,income-tax:02c83d,pay-salary:4d4435","at":"2026-11-02","pages":["en/pilot-salary-guide.html"]},
  "What we show is the Monthly Base Pay only. The airline itself lists 21 further items as benefits \"over and above Base pay\".": {"es":"Lo que mostramos es solo el sueldo base mensual. La propia aerolínea enumera otros 21 conceptos como prestaciones \"por encima del sueldo base\".","st":"validated","by":"ai","model":"claude-opus-5-5","pv":4,"gl":"airline:8a75a5,base-pay-basic-salary:bea199,pay-salary:4d4435","at":"2026-11-02","pages":["en/airlines/saudia.html"]},
  "What you actually flew that month (block hours). Enter <g1>0</g1> if you did not fly, or do not track hours.": {"es":"Lo que realmente volaste ese mes (horas block, calzo a calzo). Ingresa <g1>0</g1> si no volaste o si no llevas registro de tus horas.","st":"validated","by":"ai","model":"claude-opus-5-5","pv":3,"gl":"block-hours-block-time:8db174","at":"2026-11-02","pages":["en/pay-report.html"]},
  "What you have contributed": {"es":"Lo que has aportado","st":"validated","by":"ai","model":"claude-opus-5-5","pv":3,"gl":"","at":"2026-11-02","pages":["en/profile.html"]},
  "What you reach by flying the target hours (not a guaranteed amount) · As of January 2026": {"es":"Lo que alcanzas si vuelas las horas objetivo (no es un monto garantizado) · A enero de 2026","st":"validated","by":"ai","model":"claude-opus-5-5","pv":4,"gl":"","at":"2026-11-02","pages":["en/airlines/cathay-pacific.html"]},
  "What you write becomes the <g1>basis for the decision</g1> of the next pilot who takes the leap. The more concretely you describe your own experience — how the work really is, the atmosphere in training, how close management feels — the more valuable your review becomes for the person reading it. And the more detail you share, the deeper you can read the reality at other airlines — let's make this a place where <g2>everyone gains</g2>.": {"es":"Lo que escribas será la <g1>base para la decisión</g1> del próximo piloto que dé el salto. Cuanto más concretamente describas tu propia experiencia — cómo es realmente el trabajo, el ambiente en el entrenamiento, qué tan cercana se siente la dirección —, más valiosa será tu reseña para quien la lea. Y cuanto más detalle compartas, más a fondo podrás conocer la realidad de otras aerolíneas: hagamos de este un lugar donde <g2>todos ganen</g2>.","st":"validated","by":"ai","model":"claude-opus-5-5","pv":4,"gl":"management-leadership-role:1885bd,pilot:543af6,review:9b4a21","at":"2026-11-02","pages":["en/submit-review.html"]},
