  "Your monthly gross × 12, plus the annual bonus and profit share.": {"es":"Tu sueldo bruto mensual × 12, más el bono anual y la participación en las utilidades.","st":"validated","by":"ai","model":"claude-opus-5-5","pv":1,"gl":"annual-bonus:b192eb,profit-share:f7314c","at":"2026-11-02","pages":["en/pay-report.html"]},
  "Your name, staff number and bank details are blacked out in your browser before anything is sent. The image itself is never stored.": {"es":"Tu nombre, número de empleado y datos bancarios se tapan en tu navegador antes de enviar nada. La imagen en sí nunca se guarda.","st":"validated","by":"ai","model":"claude-opus-5-5","pv":4,"gl":"","at":"2026-11-02","pages":["en/index.html"]},
  "Your net pay is higher than your gross pay. Net is what is left <g1>after</g1> tax and deductions. Please check the two figures are not swapped.": {"es":"Tu sueldo neto es mayor que tu sueldo bruto. El neto es lo que queda <g1>después</g1> de impuestos y deducciones. Revisa que no hayas invertido las dos cifras.","st":"validated","by":"ai","model":"claude-opus-5-5","pv":3,"gl":"deductions:5a7943,gross-pay:acca3d,net-pay:6e15fc,pay-salary:4d4435","at":"2026-11-02","pages":["en/pay-report.html"]},
  "Your pay report now lives in MY PAGE": {"es":"Tu informe de remuneración ahora está en MI PÁGINA","st":"validated","by":"ai","model":"claude-opus-5-5","pv":3,"gl":"pay-salary:4d4435","at":"2026-11-02","pages":["en/my-value.html"]},
  "Your pay, month by month: this month, the total built up since you started, and the change since your last payslip. Payslip images are blacked out in your browser before they are sent, and are never stored.": {"es":"Tu remuneración, mes a mes: la de este mes, el total acumulado desde que empezaste y la variación desde tu último recibo de nómina. Las imágenes de los recibos de nómina se tapan en tu navegador antes de enviarse y nunca se almacenan.","st":"validated","by":"ai","model":"claude-opus-5-5","pv":3,"gl":"pay-salary:4d4435,payslip:c09b58","at":"2026-11-02","pages":["en/my-value.html"]},
  "Your payslip image is sent to an AI service (Anthropic, USA) to read the pay figures. <g1>Your name, staff number, bank details and similar are not part of what is returned or stored, and PILOT VALUE never stores the image.</g1> Please do not send documents that show a national ID or tax number (such as Japan’s My Number). <g2>How we handle it</g2>": {"es":"La imagen de tu recibo de nómina se envía a un servicio de IA (Anthropic, EE. UU.) para leer las cifras de pago. <g1>Tu nombre, tu número de empleado, tus datos bancarios y otros datos similares no forman parte de lo que se devuelve ni de lo que se guarda, y PILOT VALUE nunca guarda la imagen.</g1> No envíes documentos que muestren un número de identificación nacional o fiscal (como el My Number de Japón). <g2>Cómo lo tratamos</g2>","st":"manual","by":"claude-review","at":"2026-11-04","pages":["en/pay-report.html","en/personal-data.html","en/index.html"],"note":"明細の読み取りの作り直し（2026-11-04）。用語は glossary-es（recibo de nómina）にそろえた"},
  "Your payslip is used only to read the pay figures; your name, staff number and bank details are not part of what is returned or stored. The image itself is never stored.": {"es":"Tu recibo de nómina se usa solo para leer las cifras de pago; tu nombre, tu número de empleado y tus datos bancarios no forman parte de lo que se devuelve ni de lo que se guarda. La imagen nunca se guarda.","st":"manual","by":"claude-review","at":"2026-11-04","pages":["en/pay-report.html","en/personal-data.html","en/index.html"],"note":"明細の読み取りの作り直し（2026-11-04）。用語は glossary-es（recibo de nómina）にそろえた"},
