  "js:'※ Compared against our published range for that airline and seat. <b>It does not account for fleet, years of experience or contract type.</b> In tax-free countries the gross figure is close to take-home, so the real gap is wider than this pre-tax line-up shows.'": {"es":"js:'※ Comparación con nuestro rango publicado para esa aerolínea y ese puesto. <b>No toma en cuenta la flota, los años de experiencia ni el tipo de contrato.</b> En los países sin impuestos el monto bruto es cercano al neto, así que la diferencia real es mayor de lo que muestra esta comparación antes de impuestos.'","st":"validated","by":"ai","model":"claude-opus-5-5","pv":4,"gl":"airline:8a75a5,contract-type:b26c58,contract:1ddc3a,fleet:56d21e,standby:08030a","at":"2026-11-02","pages":["payslip.js"]},
  "js:'※ Enter your pay allowance by allowance and this grey circle splits into items. Reading a payslip fills it in automatically.'": {"es":"js:'※ Ingresa tu remuneración asignación por asignación y este círculo gris se dividirá en conceptos. Al leer un recibo de nómina, se completa automáticamente.'","st":"validated","by":"ai","model":"claude-opus-5-5","pv":4,"gl":"allowance:8e7744,pay-salary:4d4435,payslip:c09b58","at":"2026-11-02","pages":["my-value.js"]},
  "js:'※ Imputed income that is taken straight back in the deductions column by the same amount (e.g. taxable staff travel). Your take-home does not change, so it is left out of the hourly figures.'": {"es":"js:'※ Ingreso imputado que se descuenta de inmediato en la columna de deducciones por el mismo monto (p. ej., boletos de empleado gravables). Lo que recibes en mano no cambia, así que se excluye de las cifras por hora.'","st":"validated","by":"ai","model":"claude-opus-5-5","pv":4,"gl":"deductions:5a7943,standby:08030a","at":"2026-11-02","pages":["payslip.js"]},
  "js:'※ Money your union pays you directly is not printed on the company payslip. It is included here as pay you received.'": {"es":"js:'※ El dinero que te paga directamente tu sindicato no aparece en el recibo de nómina de la empresa. Aquí se incluye como remuneración que recibiste.'","st":"validated","by":"ai","model":"claude-opus-5-5","pv":4,"gl":"pay-salary:4d4435,payslip:c09b58,union-association-pay:026844,union-pilot-representative:a58247","at":"2026-11-02","pages":["my-value.js"]},
  "js:'※ The gross printed on your slip is already net of this reduction. We do not subtract it a second time. The line name and the amount are recorded as they are.'": {"es":"js:'※ El bruto impreso en tu recibo ya tiene descontada esta reducción. No la restamos por segunda vez. El nombre del concepto y el monto se registran tal como aparecen.'","st":"validated","by":"ai","model":"claude-opus-5-5","pv":4,"gl":"","at":"2026-11-02","pages":["payslip.js"]},
  "js:'※ The gross total we read is too small for a monthly figure. A decimal point was probably misread — please compare every amount with your payslip.'": {"es":"js:'※ El total bruto que leímos es demasiado bajo para una cifra mensual. Probablemente se leyó mal un punto decimal — compara cada monto con tu recibo de nómina.'","st":"validated","by":"ai","model":"claude-opus-5-5","pv":4,"gl":"compare:0740b9,payslip:c09b58","at":"2026-11-02","pages":["payslip.js"]},
  "js:'※ The image was hard to read, so confidence is low. Please check every figure.'": {"es":"js:'※ La imagen era difícil de leer, así que la lectura es poco confiable. Revisa cada cifra.'","st":"validated","by":"ai","model":"claude-opus-5-5","pv":4,"gl":"","at":"2026-11-02","pages":["payslip.js"]},
  "js:'※ These are picked up from the order of your own records. Nothing here is confirmed as a move or a promotion — they are markers, so you can compare the real amounts either side.'": {"es":"js:'※ Se detectan a partir del orden de tus propios registros. Nada de esto está confirmado como un cambio o un ascenso: son marcadores para que puedas comparar los montos reales antes y después.'","st":"validated","by":"ai","model":"claude-opus-5-5","pv":4,"gl":"compare:0740b9","at":"2026-11-02","pages":["my-value.js"]},
  "js:'※ Total deductions, net pay and duty hours are <b>stored with this report</b> too when you submit (they drive your duty-hour rate and take-home). The <b>breakdown</b> of deductions is never stored.'": {"es":"js:'※ El total de deducciones, el sueldo neto y el tiempo de servicio también <b>se guardan con este reporte</b> al enviarlo (con ellos se calculan tu remuneración por hora de servicio y lo que recibes en mano). El <b>desglose</b> de las deducciones nunca se guarda.'","st":"validated","by":"ai","model":"claude-opus-5-5","pv":4,"gl":"deductions:5a7943,duty-time-duty-hours:3f28fe,net-pay:6e15fc,pay-salary:4d4435,standby:08030a,submit:a480e6","at":"2026-11-02","pages":["payslip.js"]},
  "js:'※ Unpaid-absence deductions are taken off the gross on your payslip. This circle shows the items before that deduction, so the total here is larger than the printed gross by that amount.'": {"es":"js:'※ Los descuentos por ausencias sin goce de sueldo se restan del sueldo bruto en tu recibo de nómina. Este círculo muestra los conceptos antes de ese descuento, así que el total aquí supera en ese monto al sueldo bruto impreso.'","st":"validated","by":"ai","model":"claude-opus-5-5","pv":4,"gl":"deductions:5a7943,payslip:c09b58","at":"2026-11-02","pages":["my-value.js"]},
