  "jsl:'Pay data'": {"es":"jsl:'Datos de remuneración'","st":"validated","by":"ai","model":"claude-opus-5-5","pv":4,"gl":"pay-salary:4d4435","at":"2026-11-02","pages":["en/profile.html"]},
  "jsl:'Pay is on the low side, as you would expect from an LCC. That said, there is scope for younger pilots to step up early. Mostly domestic routes, so the schedule is relatively regular. Many people build experience here and then move on.'": {"es":"jsl:'El sueldo es más bien bajo, como es de esperar en una aerolínea de bajo costo. Dicho esto, hay margen para que los pilotos jóvenes asciendan pronto. Son principalmente rutas domésticas, así que la programación es relativamente regular. Muchos acumulan experiencia aquí y luego se van.'","st":"validated","by":"ai","model":"claude-opus-5-5","pv":4,"gl":"pay-salary:4d4435","at":"2026-11-02","pages":["en/community.html"]},
  "jsl:'Pay is on the same level as ANA. Upgrade speed varies by fleet. The A350 is relatively new and has upgrade slots available. Benefits and the retirement scheme are comprehensive. Work-life balance is good.'": {"es":"jsl:'El sueldo está al mismo nivel que en ANA. La velocidad de ascenso varía según la flota. El A350 es relativamente nuevo y tiene vacantes de ascenso. Las prestaciones y el plan de retiro son completos. El equilibrio entre trabajo y vida personal es bueno.'","st":"validated","by":"ai","model":"claude-opus-5-5","pv":4,"gl":"fleet:56d21e,pay-salary:4d4435","at":"2026-11-02","pages":["en/community.html"]},
