  "jsl:'Sun Country Airlines'": {"es":"jsl:'Sun Country Airlines'","st":"validated","by":"ai","model":"claude-opus-5-5","pv":4,"gl":"","at":"2026-11-02","pages":["en/submit-review.html"]},
  "jsl:'Swiss International Air Lines (SWISS)'": {"es":"jsl:'Swiss International Air Lines (SWISS)'","st":"validated","by":"ai","model":"claude-opus-5-5","pv":4,"gl":"","at":"2026-11-02","pages":["en/submit-review.html"]},
  "jsl:'TAP Air Portugal'": {"es":"jsl:'TAP Air Portugal'","st":"validated","by":"ai","model":"claude-opus-5-5","pv":4,"gl":"","at":"2026-11-02","pages":["en/submit-review.html"]},
  "jsl:'Tax-free pay is powerful, but schedule flexibility is on the low side. With Doha as your base, living costs are high if you bring your family. Training is well resourced. The fleet is varied — A350 / A380 / B777.'": {"es":"jsl:'El sueldo libre de impuestos pesa mucho, pero la flexibilidad de la programación es más bien baja. Con base en Doha, el costo de vida es alto si llevas a tu familia. La formación cuenta con buenos recursos. La flota es variada: A350 / A380 / B777.'","st":"validated","by":"ai","model":"claude-opus-5-5","pv":4,"gl":"fleet:56d21e,pay-salary:4d4435","at":"2026-11-02","pages":["en/community.html"]},
  "jsl:'Thai Airways International'": {"es":"jsl:'Thai Airways International'","st":"validated","by":"ai","model":"claude-opus-5-5","pv":4,"gl":"","at":"2026-11-02","pages":["en/submit-review.html"]},
  "jsl:'That code is wrong or has expired. Please resend and try again.'": {"es":"jsl:'Ese código es incorrecto o ya venció. Reenvía el correo e inténtalo de nuevo.'","st":"validated","by":"ai","model":"claude-opus-5-5","pv":4,"gl":"","at":"2026-11-02","pages":["en/signup.html"]},
  "jsl:'That code is wrong or has expired. Resend the email and try again.'": {"es":"jsl:'Ese código es incorrecto o ya venció. Reenvía el correo e inténtalo de nuevo.'","st":"validated","by":"ai","model":"claude-opus-5-5","pv":4,"gl":"","at":"2026-11-02","pages":["en/login.html"]},
  "jsl:'That is above the range we can compare against other airlines. An extra digit, or an annual figure typed into the monthly box, would both look like this. If it is right, submit it as it is.'": {"es":"jsl:'Esa cifra está por encima del rango que podemos comparar con otras aerolíneas. Un dígito de más, o una cifra anual escrita en la casilla mensual, se verían así. Si es correcta, envíala tal como está.'","st":"validated","by":"ai","model":"claude-opus-5-5","pv":4,"gl":"compare:0740b9,submit:a480e6","at":"2026-11-02","pages":["en/pay-report.html"]},
  "jsl:'That is below the range we can compare against other airlines. A missing digit, an amount typed in thousands, or the wrong currency would all look like this. If it is right, submit it as it is.'": {"es":"jsl:'Está por debajo del rango que podemos comparar con otras aerolíneas. Un dígito faltante, un monto escrito en miles o una moneda equivocada se verían así. Si es correcto, envíalo tal como está.'","st":"validated","by":"ai","model":"claude-opus-5-5","pv":4,"gl":"compare:0740b9,submit:a480e6","at":"2026-11-02","pages":["en/pay-report.html"]},
  "jsl:'The cost of living in Singapore is high, but so is income. Pay is SGD-based, so a weak yen works in your favor. There is no jumpseat culture and the atmosphere on board is professional. Upgrades run strictly on seniority.'": {"es":"jsl:'El costo de vida en Singapur es alto, pero los ingresos también. El sueldo es en SGD, así que un yen débil te favorece. No hay cultura de jumpseat y el ambiente a bordo es profesional. Los ascensos van estrictamente por antigüedad.'","st":"validated","by":"ai","model":"claude-opus-5-5","pv":4,"gl":"pay-salary:4d4435,seniority:b57888","at":"2026-11-02","pages":["en/community.html"]},
  "jsl:'The report you just filled in is held on the server. Claim it and <b style=\"color:#f5c842\">the pay data for every airline unlocks for 90 days</b>.'": {"es":"jsl:'El reporte que acabas de llenar está guardado en el servidor. Vincúlalo a tu cuenta y <b style=\"color:#f5c842\">los datos de remuneración de todas las aerolíneas se desbloquean por 90 días</b>.'","st":"validated","by":"ai","model":"claude-opus-5-5","pv":4,"gl":"airline:8a75a5,pay-salary:4d4435","at":"2026-11-02","pages":["en/signup.html"]},
  "jsl:'The same character is repeated too many times (e.g. \"aaaaa\"). Please write what you actually experienced.'": {"es":"jsl:'El mismo carácter se repite demasiadas veces (p. ej., \"aaaaa\"). Escribe lo que realmente viviste.'","st":"validated","by":"ai","model":"claude-opus-5-5","pv":4,"gl":"","at":"2026-11-02","pages":["en/submit-review.html"]},
  "jsl:'The same phrase is repeated too often (e.g. \"...is low...is low...\"). Please rewrite it with specific content.'": {"es":"jsl:'La misma frase se repite demasiadas veces (p. ej., \"...es bajo...es bajo...\"). Reescríbela con contenido concreto.'","st":"validated","by":"ai","model":"claude-opus-5-5","pv":4,"gl":"","at":"2026-11-02","pages":["en/submit-review.html"]},
  "jsl:'The same text has been pasted into several categories. Please write each category specifically, from its own point of view.'": {"es":"jsl:'Se pegó el mismo texto en varias categorías. Escribe cada categoría de forma concreta, desde su propio punto de vista.'","st":"validated","by":"ai","model":"claude-opus-5-5","pv":4,"gl":"","at":"2026-11-02","pages":["en/submit-review.html"]},
  "jsl:'The submission failed. Please try again in a little while. ('": {"es":"jsl:'No se pudo enviar. Vuelve a intentarlo en un momento. ('","st":"validated","by":"ai","model":"claude-opus-5-5","pv":4,"gl":"","at":"2026-11-02","pages":["en/submit-review.html"]},
  "jsl:'The two passwords do not match'": {"es":"jsl:'Las dos contraseñas no coinciden'","st":"validated","by":"ai","model":"claude-opus-5-5","pv":4,"gl":"","at":"2026-11-02","pages":["en/profile.html"]},
  "jsl:'There is a solid sense of stability as a mid-size domestic carrier. Pay is lower than at ANA / JAL, but upgrades come faster. Schedule flexibility is somewhat better. Training is done in-house and is at a standard level.'": {"es":"jsl:'Como aerolínea doméstica mediana, hay una sensación sólida de estabilidad. El sueldo es menor que en ANA / JAL, pero los ascensos llegan más rápido. La flexibilidad de la programación es algo mejor. La formación se hace internamente y es de nivel estándar.'","st":"validated","by":"ai","model":"claude-opus-5-5","pv":4,"gl":"pay-salary:4d4435","at":"2026-11-02","pages":["en/community.html"]},
  "jsl:'This email address is already registered'": {"es":"jsl:'Este correo electrónico ya está registrado'","st":"validated","by":"ai","model":"claude-opus-5-5","pv":4,"gl":"","at":"2026-11-02","pages":["en/signup.html"]},
  "jsl:'This month is already saved as yours. We will not save it twice.'": {"es":"jsl:'Este mes ya está guardado como tuyo. No lo guardaremos dos veces.'","st":"validated","by":"ai","model":"claude-opus-5-5","pv":4,"gl":"","at":"2026-11-02","pages":["en/pay-report.html"]},
  "jsl:'This was judged to be a meaningless string of characters (keyboard mashing). Please describe your actual experience in sentences.'": {"es":"jsl:'Se determinó que es una cadena de caracteres sin sentido (teclear al azar). Describe tu experiencia real con oraciones.'","st":"validated","by":"ai","model":"claude-opus-5-5","pv":4,"gl":"","at":"2026-11-02","pages":["en/submit-review.html"]},
  "jsl:'This was judged to be a meaningless string of characters (the same pattern repeated). Please rewrite it with specific content.'": {"es":"jsl:'Se determinó que es una cadena de caracteres sin sentido (el mismo patrón repetido). Reescribe el texto con contenido concreto.'","st":"validated","by":"ai","model":"claude-opus-5-5","pv":4,"gl":"","at":"2026-11-02","pages":["en/submit-review.html"]},
