  "jsl:'With an hourly rate we also need flight time or guaranteed flight time.'": {"es":"jsl:'Con una tarifa por hora también necesitamos las horas de vuelo o las horas garantizadas.'","st":"validated","by":"ai","model":"claude-opus-5-5","pv":4,"gl":"flight-time-flight-hours:a387d6,flight-time-guarantee-guaranteed-flight-time:321517","at":"2026-11-02","pages":["en/pay-report.html"]},
  "jsl:'With the seniority system, upgrades and route bidding are completely transparent. It is an all-B737 operation, so no type transitions are needed. Pass benefits are generous and the whole family can travel almost free. Medical insurance and the 401(k) are excellent too.'": {"es":"jsl:'Con el sistema de antigüedad, los ascensos y la solicitud de rutas (bidding) son totalmente transparentes. Toda la operación es B737, así que no hay cambios de tipo. Los beneficios de pases son generosos y toda la familia puede viajar casi gratis. El seguro médico y el 401(k) también son excelentes.'","st":"validated","by":"ai","model":"claude-opus-5-5","pv":4,"gl":"seniority:b57888","at":"2026-11-02","pages":["en/community.html"]},
  "jsl:'Wizz Air UK'": {"es":"jsl:'Wizz Air UK'","st":"validated","by":"ai","model":"claude-opus-5-5","pv":4,"gl":"","at":"2026-11-02","pages":["en/submit-review.html"]},
